        "Description": "Welcome to china town where for some reason you&apos;re killing some white dude, brown man and some black guy chilling at a table. The whole reason for this fiasco is because someone in this town took your sandwich and threw it on the ground, you heard a little birdie sing that this hasmat building had someone evil enough to do that to a sandwich so it begins...\r\rFinally after so many interrogations (torture) you got the three man squad that did, time for some REVENGE!",
